{"t":"HSY","n":"The Hershey Company","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":172.56,"chg":-2.92,"chgPct":-0.01664,"prev":175.48,"dayH":175.43,"dayL":172.4,"w52H":239.48,"w52L":156.16,"vol":2355543,"avgVol":2226260,"mcap":34681176064,"pe":19.52,"fpe":18.22,"eps":8.84,"feps":9.47,"pb":7.11,"div":5.81,"divY":0.0337,"beta":0.07,"short":9574518,"shortPct":0.0767,"shortRatio":5.84,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Defensive","sKo":"소비자 방어","i":"Confectioners","iKo":"제과점","city":"Hershey","emp":17550,"web":"https://www.thehersheycompany.com","sum":"The Hershey Company, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the manufacture and sale of confectionery products and pantry items in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: North America Confectionery, North America Salty Snacks, and International. The company offers chocolate and non-chocolate confectionery products; gum and mint refreshment products, including mints, chewing gums, and bubble gums; protein bars; pantry items, such as baking ingredients, toppings, beverages, and sundae syrups; and snack items comprising spreads, bars, snack bites, mixes, popcorn, and pretzels. It provides its products primarily under the Hershey's, Reese's, Kisses, Jolly Rancher, Almond Joy, Brookside, barkTHINS, Cadbury, Good & Plenty, Heath, Kit Kat, Payday, Rolo, Twi","sumKo":"Hershey Company는 자회사와 함께 미국 및 해외에서 제과 제품 및 식료품 저장실 품목의 제조 및 판매에 종사하고 있습니다. North America Confectionery, North America Salty Snacks 및 International의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 초콜릿 및 초콜릿이 아닌 제과 제품을 제공합니다. 민트, 츄잉껌, 풍선껌을 포함한 껌 및 민트 다과 제품; 단백질 바; 베이킹 재료, 토핑, 음료 및 순대 시럽과 같은 식품 저장실 품목; 스프레드, 바, 스낵 바이트, 믹스, 팝콘 및 프레첼로 구성된 스낵 품목. 주로 Hershey's, Reese's, Kisses, Jolly Rancher, Almond Joy, Brookside, barkTHINS, Cadbury, Good & Plenty, Heath, Kit Kat, Payday, Rolo, Twi로 제품을 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":10419294000,"ni":1644817000},{"y":2023,"rev":11164992000,"ni":1861787000},{"y":2024,"rev":11202263000,"ni":2221239000},{"y":2025